{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Day 21 — Time series with pandas\n","Objectives:\n","- Date parsing and DateTimeIndex.\n","- Resampling (D/W/M), rolling windows.\n","- Time zone awareness basics."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[],"source":["import pandas as pd, numpy as np\n","rng = pd.date_range('2024-01-01', periods=120, freq='D')\n","ts = pd.Series(np.random.randn(len(rng)).cumsum(), index=rng, name='value')\n","ts.head(), ts.index\n","\n","# Resample monthly\n","monthly = ts.resample('M').mean()\n","rolling = ts.rolling(window=7).mean()\n","monthly.head(), rolling.head()\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Exercises\n","1) Create business-day time series and compute weekly sums.\n","2) Add a time zone to a timestamp column and convert to UTC.\n"]}]}
